---
import Slide from "../../components/Slide.astro"
// import Link from "../../components/Link.astro"
// import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro"
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import complex_helper from "../../img/p5/complex-helper.png"
---
<Slide t2="The Complex Plane">
    <ul>
        <li class="fragment">We have already looked at the complex number
            plane (real numbers horizontally, imaginary numbers vertically)</li>

        <li class="fragment">We can build complex numbers (using Math.js)
            and then plot them using P5</li>

        <li class="fragment">From here we can do simple complex arithmetic
            and plot the results</li>
    </ul>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Complex Number Helper">
    <ul>
        <li class="fragment">An interactive P5 sketch which shows
            complex number addition</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="fragment flex justify-center items-center">
        <Image
            src={ complex_helper }
            alt="Complex Helper"
            height="400"
            width="400" />
    </div>

    <ul>
        <li class="fragment">Can you modify it to show multiplication?</li>
    </ul>
</Slide>